Modifications for Dialtone: package renamed to app.dialtone.phone.vvm; Dialer-internal dependencies
(Dagger components, executors, analytics, feature flags, Volley, AutoValue, Guava, commons-io)
replaced with small local equivalents; Google cloud transcription, archiving and the developer
config-override screen removed; a public-API IPv4 check replaces a platform-only call; an
on-device diagnostics log was added.

This product depends on Apache James Mime4j (Apache License 2.0).

